My good lord,

I am not wholly easy about the lead and bells of Tintern Abbey, and would val=
ue a quiet word before we commit anything to writing.

Keep your head about you in tomorrow's council.

By the hand that serves the Crown,
Lord Chancellor Thomas Audley

